This is a direct contradiction. The harness is authoritative.

Exit code 124 typically indicates timeout. The `npm test` suite timing out at 900s suggests either:
1. The new 120-line test suite or other changes introduced an infinite loop/deadlock
2. A test is hanging waiting for an external call
3. The code changes caused severe test performance regression

The agent's iteration 2 report appears to be misrepresenting actual test status.

